<p>For a brief moment your whole body becomes etheral and you dash into a nearby creature and all those in straight line behind it (in range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym>).</p><p>You reappear on the other side, with <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14, 28, 42, 56, 70</acronym> more psi and having dealt <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> mind damage to your targets.</p><p></p>